---

---

<section class="why-charge-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="why-charge-inner">
            <img src="/images/logos/ontarget/ontarget_black_green.png" alt="" />
            <div class="why-charge-content">
                <h2 class="why-charge-title">
                    Why we charge - and why it's worth it
                </h2>

                <p class="why-charge-intro">
                    This isn't a one-time calculator. It's an ongoing planning
                    tool.
                </p>

                <p class="why-charge-description">
                    Retirement planning isn't something you do once. It's
                    something you revisit as markets, life, and priorities
                    change.
                </p>

                <div class="pro-subscription">
                    <p class="pro-subscription-title">
                        Your Pro subscription supports:
                    </p>

                    <ul class="pro-features-list">
                        <li>Continuous improvements</li>
                        <li>New features and modeling tools</li>
                        <li>Accurate, thoughtful assumptions</li>
                        <li>
                            A product &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; built for
                            planners - not advertisers
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="trust-statements">
                    <p>We don't sell your data.</p>
                    <p>We don't push products.</p>
                    <p>Our incentives are aligned with your clarity.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .why-charge-section {
        padding: 4rem 0;
    }
    .why-charge-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        img {
            height: 5.625rem;
        }
    }

    .why-charge-content {
        background-color: #e8e8e8;
        padding: 3rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        max-width: 700px;
    }

    .why-charge-title {
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
        line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .why-charge-intro {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .why-charge-description {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin: 0 0 2rem 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .pro-subscription {
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .pro-subscription-title {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    }

    .pro-features-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0;
    }

    .pro-features-list li {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
        position: relative;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .pro-features-list li::before {
        content: "✓";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: #5a6c7d;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .trust-statements {
        border-top: 2px solid #c0c0c0;
        padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .trust-statements p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #2c3e50;
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .trust-statements p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .why-charge-section {
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
        }

        .why-charge-content {
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        }

        .why-charge-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .why-charge-intro,
        .why-charge-description,
        .trust-statements p {
            font-size: 0.9375rem;
        }

        .pro-features-list li {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
        .why-charge-content {
            padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
        }

        .why-charge-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }
    }
</style>
